msgid "Nectarblocks"
msgstr "Nectarblocks"

#. Description of the plugin
#: nectar-blocks.php
msgid ""
"Step into the future of WordPress with Nectarblocks, where innovation meets "
"seamless design. Unleash the full potential of your website by transforming "
"the core WordPress editor into a dynamic and robust full-site editor."
msgstr ""
"Schreiten Sie mit Nectarblocks in die Zukunft von WordPress, wo Innovation "
"auf nahtloses Design trifft. Entfalten Sie das volle Potenzial Ihrer "
"Website, indem Sie den WordPress Core-Editor in einen dynamischen und "
"leistungsstarken Full-Site-Editor verwandeln."

